-- Classic 1.60 (WoW Forever): Darkmoon Faire Prize Ticket (19182). The Faire runs again (world 2026_10_25_36), but the ticket is in
-- the 70532 Item.db2 and not in its ItemSparse.db2, so the server had no such item: every Faire turn-in (Yebb, Kerri, Chronos,
-- Rinling, the barkers' quests) paid nothing and Gelvas Grimegate's nine prize quests could never be done. One item_sparse row from
-- the vMaNGOS 1.12 item (stack 200), written by tools/classic_items/gen_hotfix_items.py, sent to clients through hotfix_data like
-- the Seal of Ascension (2026_10_16_00). Only this item; the other missing vanilla items stay as Forever has them. Check in game:
-- ".additem 19182" shows the ticket with its icon and a turn-in at the Faire pays it. Safe to run again.
DELETE FROM `item_sparse` WHERE `ID` IN (19182);
